# .gitignore for {{PROJECT_NAME}}
#
# --- Workflow files: committed or kept local? -----------------------------
# DEFAULT: COMMITTED. CLAUDE.md, STATE.md, docs/, journal/ and
# .claude/commands/ are tracked, so a fresh clone has them and "git clean"
# cannot delete them.
# If the remote is public and the planning notes must stay private,
# uncomment the five lines below. Then never run "git clean -fd" in this
# repo, and change the last bullet of CLAUDE.md section 9 in the same edit.
# The choice is recorded here; no other file may contradict it.
#CLAUDE.md
#STATE.md
#docs/
#journal/
#.claude/commands/

# --- Always local ---------------------------------------------------------
# Per-machine tool approvals. Never shared.
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Secrets --------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# --- Dependencies, build output, caches -----------------------------------
# > FILL: the dependency, build-output and cache directories of {{STACK}}, one pattern per line.
